Texture packs for paletted textures (Melee-NX-NetPlay 0.4.8): the frontend decodes CI4/CI8/CI14 textures to RGBA8 itself, which leaves them without a Dolphin name; while a pack is loaded the decoded copy is tied to the Dolphin name of the texture it came from (aurora::texture::alias_pointer, patches/0124), and while dumping the decoded picture is dumped under that name (src/gfx_render.cpp). After 0106, 0116 and 0120.
